---
import LegalLayout from '@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  updated="September 2026"
  description="How Compliance Navigator handles data. The site is a free, static reference and collects as little as possible."
>
  <p>
    Compliance Navigator is a free, informational reference. It is a static
    website with no user accounts, and it is built to collect as little
    information as possible.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>
    We do not ask for, require, or store personal information to use this site.
    There is no sign-up, login, or profile.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Search.</strong> Searching runs entirely in your browser. Your
      search queries are not sent to or stored on a server.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Server logs.</strong> Like most websites, our hosting provider may
      automatically record standard request information (such as IP address and
      user agent) to serve pages and protect the service. These logs are not
      used to identify you.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
  <p>
    We do not use tracking or advertising cookies. See our
    <a href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a> for details.
  </p>

  <h2>Third parties</h2>
  <p>
    We load web fonts from Google Fonts, which may involve a request to Google's
    servers to deliver the font files. We do not share personal information with
    third parties for advertising.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy as the product evolves. Material changes will be
    reflected by the "last updated" date above.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about privacy? Reach us at
    <a href="mailto:privacy@wyzer.io">privacy@wyzer.io</a>.
  </p>

  <hr />
  <p>
    This page describes how the site works today and is provided for
    transparency. It is not legal advice.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
